| !Boot for Write
If "<Write$Dir>"="" Then Set Write$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Write$Dir>.!Sprites
If "<File$Type_0A0>"="" Then Set File$Type_0A0 Write
If "<Alias$@RunType_0A0>"="" Then Set Alias$@RunType_0A0 Run <Write$Dir>.!Run %%*0
| RTF (&C32): Write opens it, unless another application has said it will
If "<File$Type_C32>"="" Then Set File$Type_C32 RTF
If "<Alias$@RunType_C32>"="" Then Set Alias$@RunType_C32 Run <Write$Dir>.!Run %%*0
| the spelling dictionary: the box disc's (ports/rossqlite), as a macro so
| that BoxDisc$Dir is read when Write starts
If "<Write$Dictionary>"="" Then SetMacro Write$Dictionary <BoxDisc$Dir>.Resources.Dictionaries.spelldict
